Subject: [PATCH] ikvm: initialize the framebuffer at 1024x768

Use 1024x768 for the initial CEB-GNRD VNC framebuffer. Video format and
timing detection continue to replace these dimensions with the actual
capture resolution once the video device supplies it.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD initial display size]

--- a/ikvm_video.cpp
+++ b/ikvm_video.cpp
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
 
 Video::Video(const std::string& p, Input& input, int fr, int sub) :
     resizeAfterOpen(false), timingsError(false), fd(-1), frameRate(fr),
-    lastFrameIndex(-1), height(600), width(800), subSampling(sub), input(input),
+    lastFrameIndex(-1), height(768), width(1024), subSampling(sub), input(input),
     path(p), bitsPerSample(8), bytesPerPixel(4), samplesPerPixel(3)
 {}
 
